Grey Beard Ansible — Field Kit

This is an independent tool, not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by
Red Hat, Inc., the Ansible project, or any vendor.

Content derivation:
- Ansible module schemas, parameter documentation, and CLI flag descriptions are
  extracted programmatically from the locally installed ansible-core
  distribution's own documentation tooling (ansible-doc --json, <cli> --help),
  under its documented usage. Extraction is version-stamped (see
  content/modules.json _meta).
- RHEL administration content is paraphrased from Red Hat Enterprise Linux
  product documentation and man pages; entries carry a `source` field naming
  the origin. No extended verbatim vendor passages are included.
- Error signatures and decision trees are original work informed by the
  referenced documentation and operational experience.

"Ansible" and "Red Hat" are trademarks of Red Hat, Inc., used here only to
identify the software the tool documents.
